{"title":"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Essentially_the_same_thing_as_Solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Essentially the same thing as Solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/9/28969a57466b0a1047fca37478da706c1cb8cced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are integers. Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d358367015e5ceeb10a72c78d0b627d586f3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10bf8164e8f9f03ab077a50bac52fd90c77d0177.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50&lt;f(7)&lt;60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa946baaeee00d574f7641e6eba3e35d08e32a2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70&lt;f(8)&lt;80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/b/75b043e9b7f56cfe4ddedd2fb75ecda37df5ca25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5000k&lt;f(100)&lt;5000(k+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"237\" height=\"18\" /> for some integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/8/908080b56fc36e805bfef13f09a77a76e2624126.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82dd6f474fd8d40d5108934acc4ce4f98bfd3c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d501f3412e3af870e232678a6b686d3cf311fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>From the first inequality, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/3/cf3250346ba34909d2c819c85853ba105d73896f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 &lt; 49a+7b+c &lt; 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"181\" height=\"14\" />. Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d501f3412e3af870e232678a6b686d3cf311fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> from this gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/4/2f4dfb9c60d1614703c61c64e49a3cfe957688b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 &lt; 48a+6b &lt; 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"151\" height=\"14\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba26597d03e7102253e8c9162f1003777e0b8058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{25}{3} &lt; 8a+b &lt; 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"137\" height=\"37\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/b/d5b11d8228f2dba24f6725244c149411fc2176c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> must be an integer, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/e/e0e347d037f2a0ca0eff8c156daf041fd5732ba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8a+b = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Similarly, from the second inequality, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/b/ecb63a4c9960d460e4fb0793cb80fb08d1ca1cd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70 &lt; 64a+8b+c &lt; 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"181\" height=\"14\" />. Again subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d501f3412e3af870e232678a6b686d3cf311fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> from this gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb9ca593bd1a68bd00948050dc8a80722ada915.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70 &lt; 63a+7b &lt; 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"151\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/0/040995a5227d07397a04f47b170b506be66f1606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 &lt; 9a+b &lt; \\frac{80}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"136\" height=\"37\" />. It follows from this that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/d/a3dbf6901bf76d1a84a4da02454a58a0ff35f1b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9a+b = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>We now have a system of three equations: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d501f3412e3af870e232678a6b686d3cf311fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/e/e0e347d037f2a0ca0eff8c156daf041fd5732ba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8a+b = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/d/a3dbf6901bf76d1a84a4da02454a58a0ff35f1b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9a+b = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />. Solving gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/2/ac219f63c5d8f2b973c2ceb9f5ef4f2438f8359a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c) = (2, -7, 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" /> and from this we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/1/171b4617385c9507af4a8f99059520a89fd92920.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(100) = 2(100)^2-7(100)+5 = 19305$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"307\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b659f809b3db34c7dcf22a5652af65e3b120cb54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15000 &lt; 19305 &lt; 20000 \\to 5000(3) &lt; 19305 &lt; 5000(4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/3/7a38f1ad2e2af4706a93a42722d4eb793d6ca93b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 3 \\rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"126\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is some non-monic quadratic with a root at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. Knowing this, we'll forget their silly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and instead write it as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/d/b1d8853574f295a837fba7180ccadc4ad5d95103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=p(x-1)(x-r)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"178\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7faa9f340af53616f824e108f668c09560547b24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(7)=6p(7-r)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/8/e68c56082db3d4756941a61d1f4f08fe46114108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is a multiple of 6. They say <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/8/e68c56082db3d4756941a61d1f4f08fe46114108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is between 50 and 60, exclusive. Notice that the only multiple of 6 in that range is 54. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74a16acb1676659d299afc098cfeadd82d5cfa69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(7)=6p(7-r)=54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"173\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/0/990e97f446060e99aeab3cf175f07d1613182e29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(8)=7p(8-r)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/d/9ed1d18e89d8d63ccd2c5b2739aa37aea1f85f3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is a multiple of 7. They say <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/d/9ed1d18e89d8d63ccd2c5b2739aa37aea1f85f3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is between 70 and 80, exclusive. Notice that the only multiple of 7 in that range is 77. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/9/6b922e80f9b2dad676cb108bd4ad94d10a45ad0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(8)=7p(8-r)=77$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"173\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now, we solve a system of equations in two variables. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/d/eadd50c2258c9ecec8ea3571bcb7d693b4cb652c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 6p(7-r)&amp;=54 \\\\ 7p(8-r)&amp;=77 \\\\ \\\\ p(7-r)&amp;=9 \\\\ p(8-r)&amp;=11 \\\\ \\\\ 7p-pr&amp;=9 \\\\ 8p-pr&amp;=11 \\\\ \\\\ (8p-pr)-(7p-pr)&amp;=11-9 \\\\ \\\\ p&amp;=2 \\\\ \\\\ 2(7-r)&amp;=9 \\\\ \\\\ r&amp;=2.5 \\end{align*}\" width=\"239\" height=\"387\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b618888e60350f76a013db1fb0695f98192529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(100)=2(100-1)(100-2.5)=19305 \\implies k=3 \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"512\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Essentially_the_same_thing_as_Solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Essentially_the_same_thing_as_Solution_1)\">Solution 3 (Essentially the same thing as Solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Essentially the same thing as Solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>So we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> are integers so we can use this to our advantage \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a64b33750afe51aa0bbd57df78838b96ddd094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p>Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d358367015e5ceeb10a72c78d0b627d586f3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, we get the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37e4c3e85710cff4f69bfec2adaff5ea38111a3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/d/e2df162ea8c9869b50ddbd5b3f36358e70306d0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(7)=49a+7b+c=5X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"207\" height=\"20\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is a decimal digit placeholder. (Ex. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/1029a9cd9cc628b02b8060e72a033738bdab6f00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> provides the value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1d1611143f5792dc0f61f3b130af88cb790c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />) \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a64b33750afe51aa0bbd57df78838b96ddd094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> using the system of equations, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/e/eae58f3d57cad6a13d05209d66767cf9ade6ea94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48a+6b=5X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/b/28b9ae18133a0c318f4cbf57cc3a80973b00f225.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-8a+ \\frac{5X}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"39\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a64b33750afe51aa0bbd57df78838b96ddd094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p>Since we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are both integers, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/e/66e8ca3fd542cd74fa902efb268a52b4c477c0c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5X}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"31\" height=\"39\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/4/134004c561e4c0cca193dbf5122e5ca963dd5b7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\in$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/0/d4023589a374e5b4a1bc6063d887aec205e0d3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/14425c57745d2c13c539e983550d2ef419b78242.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> and by extension <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/6/7e662ca66179b0dc37d144ee470d0714db42982a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-8a+9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a64b33750afe51aa0bbd57df78838b96ddd094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p>Attempting to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> again using the system <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea76a3c26f637c4b07b8d05070df3849fe53265c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(8)=64a+8b+c=7Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"205\" height=\"20\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is another decimal digit placeholder),<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/1/db124bb4acd5e8e2c1b17118bd9c04b37849b479.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=a+b+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"163\" height=\"20\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e2c5ac2d7ba7a6fe9a0704ca26aebb9ebb590c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-9a+ \\frac{7Y}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"117\" height=\"39\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd4879f2a2dfe61ccc53fa40a6b697572052282.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5af1d1f8381cab99dd963268539741fad85fb329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-9a+11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a64b33750afe51aa0bbd57df78838b96ddd094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p>This leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/d/59d536ac86d9753a49af09e8a1e660c31054a833.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-8a+9=-9a+11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"163\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55afdab16c8c49089c4d9ceeb8d3c8cf1f088be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/9/7f9ed7035cfee3ca13988beebcc80c4668d12dfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-7$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a64b33750afe51aa0bbd57df78838b96ddd094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/1/db124bb4acd5e8e2c1b17118bd9c04b37849b479.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=a+b+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"163\" height=\"20\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/f/24f7150d029fa128fa37d225f668174382d6219b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=5$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a64b33750afe51aa0bbd57df78838b96ddd094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p>Substituting the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/4/0d4ea87b4094b1168af28f5711da5c3af269e7c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(100)=10000a+100b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"221\" height=\"20\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/0/2604615bb84d53f000cd42c8046f45e323650336.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(100)=19305$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbbd3c7147e9b3c4652c139668d0d00712e1b4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5000k&lt;19305&lt;5000(k+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"234\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/3359f43f0fd0ed3b672d389374aecd0360921a47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c88676177603d4e7134e7819bb31db2c8ca62f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a64b33750afe51aa0bbd57df78838b96ddd094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c2b4d6d1a197b7afe029445513c8431f2f6a599.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bf{Note}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />: We can say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/c/2dc8ec8b1a944c8263dc10291cb790390ae06e5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(7)=5X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/e/d8e629d5498f3c89801d1d65504879e8d101a518.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(8)=7Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"20\" /> because we are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10bf8164e8f9f03ab077a50bac52fd90c77d0177.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50&lt;f(7)&lt;60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa946baaeee00d574f7641e6eba3e35d08e32a2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70&lt;f(8)&lt;80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A\">2011 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http:/